<title>UK: ABN AMRO SETS 400 MLN GUILDER 12-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO SETS 400 MLN GUILDER 12-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p>    BORROWER   ABN AMRO BANK NV</p>
<p>    AMT    400 MLN DFL   COUPON    6.125    MATURITY 30.JUN.09</p>
<p>    TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE 101.035  PAY DATE 30.JUN.97</p>
<p>    FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER   99.46   SPREAD +42 BP </p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-1-100-1M		 </p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES	</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC </p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =	  </p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 8.25 SEP.07 AND 7.5 APR.10</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
